SUMMARY:Birdwatching for Beginners
DESCRIPTION:All programs at Prairie Ridge currently require pre-registration. Register for this program for ages 8+\nWant to try birdwatching but aren’t sure how to get started? Join us for a laid-back program where you’ll learn the basics of identifying common birds! We will slowly walk about a mile to look for birds in varying habitats and learn about collaborative science projects to which we can submit our birdwatching data.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/birdwatching-for-beginners-9/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Children,Collaborative Science,Educators,K-12 Students,Outdoor Experiences,Teens
